Subject: [PATCH 29/30] perf(mimo_v2): prompt rows' experts on the EXL3 prompt
 GEMM (each expert decoded once a chunk, expert-sorted contiguous slices,
 fused silu*up*weight, slot-order sum); 16K prompt chunks; round profiler
 (TF_MIMO_PROFILE_ROUNDS). Served prefill 650 -> 1200 tok/s on 4.0 TP=2, ppl
 unchanged (4.9803 vs 4.9794)

